Description: pvr: sample 2D textures as 3D only with sampler2DViewOf3D
 pco rewrites every non-array 2D texture sample into a 3D sample with the
 z slice from the image meta data when image2DViewOf3D is enabled. For
 sampled and combined image descriptors the 2D view of a 3D image is
 allowed only with sampler2DViewOf3D; image2DViewOf3D covers storage
 images, which pco handles in the image path. Key the texture path on
 sampler2DViewOf3D. zink enables image2DViewOf3D but turns
 sampler2DViewOf3D off, so its 2D samples stay 2D.
 .
 Only for this downstream stack; not intended for upstream submission.
